flowchart LR
  ENG[Backend / Integration Engineer]
  QA[QA / CI]
  HARNESS[Webhook Receiver Conformance Harness]
  RECEIVER[Receiver Under Test]
  OBS[Command or HTTP Observer]
  FS[Local Run Bundle and SQLite Journal]
  VIEWER[CI / Browser Report Viewer]
  ENG -->|config, fixtures, secrets refs, commands| HARNESS
  QA -->|workflow inputs| HARNESS
  HARNESS -->|authorized exact-byte webhook attempts| RECEIVER
  HARNESS -->|typed read-only observation requests| OBS
  OBS -->|typed evidence| HARNESS
  HARNESS <--> |manifest, blobs, journal, projections| FS
  HARNESS -->|exit category, JUnit, JSON, static HTML| VIEWER
